# The wide frame: three lines typed and sent: the composer stays as tall as it was while the words are in it, then
# comes down as they let go of it (sfpages composer.mbt composer_hold). MBUI_WIN=1280x800.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 先看一下签名
key shift+enter
type 再看发布说明
key shift+enter
type 最后核对版本号
wait 700
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
